    <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-144" contextRef="c-30">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;13. The following occurred during the reporting period ending December 31, 2025:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Douglas Mulvey removed as Vice President, Development and appointed Vice President;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;David Wilson removed as Vice President, Environmental Permitting and appointed Vice President;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Matthew Popp removed as Vice president, Transmission and appointed Vice President;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shimon Edelstein removed as Executive Vice President, Tax;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Joseph Esteves appointed Executive Vice President and;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lawrence Willick removed as Executive Vice President.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-145" contextRef="c-30">&lt;p&gt;8. None&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id="f-146" contextRef="c-30">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;5. The following occurred during the reporting period ending December 31, 2025:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;LS Power Grid California, LLC in-serviced the Orchard Substation in Fresno County, CA on March 12th, 2025. LSPGC is a transmission-only utility and gained no retail customers as a result of this action.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock id="f-147" contextRef="c-30">&lt;p&gt;4. None&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="f-148" contextRef="c-30">&lt;p&gt;10. None&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-149" contextRef="c-30">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;6. The following occurred during the reporting period ending December 31, 2025:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;LS Power Grid California, LLC borrowed $11 million from its term loan facility authorized in FERC Docket No. ES22-14-000.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Borrowings of $188.5 million from the loan facility authorized in FERC Docket No. ES 24-38-000 were transferred from LS Power Grid California, Holdings, LLC to LS Power Grid California, LLC. Additionally, during the reporting period LS Power Grid California, LLC borrowed $106 million from its term loan facility authorized in FERC Docket No. ES24-38-000.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfPurchaseOrSaleOfAnOperatingUnitOrSystemTextBlock id="f-150" contextRef="c-30">&lt;p&gt;3. None&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfPurchaseOrSaleOfAnOperatingUnitOrSystemTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="f-151" contextRef="c-30">&lt;p&gt;14. None&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="f-152" contextRef="c-30">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;9. The following occurred during the reporting period ending December 31, 2025:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;LS Power Grid California, LLC, Docket No. ER25-2806-000 (issued Aug. 28, 2025) (delegated order) (acceptance of request for authorization to commence the collection of regulatory asset).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
