/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 15.3pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 0.8pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 56.9pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 13.15pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 50.5pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 11.45pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 40.18pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -40.18pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(9)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.35pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Related&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Party Transactions&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company receives operational and administrative services from affiliates under service management agreement. The Company reimburses these affiliates for all reasonable and necessary expenses incurred in the performance of such services, which include direct labor costs, general and administrative expenses, third party costs, overhead, travel and lodging. For the year ended December 31, 2025and 2024, the Company incurred $14.6million and $11.0 million, respectively of such reimbursable costs. In the year 2025,$9.8 million, $0.5 million and $0.3 million are included in Property, equipment and construction in progress, Regulatory assets and Other assets, respectively on the accompanying balance sheets. The remaining reimbursable costs of $3.9 million is included in Total expenses on the accompanying statement of operations. In the year 2024, $8.9 million, $1.1 million and $32 thousand are included in Property, equipment and construction in progress, Regulatory assets and Other assets, respectively, on the accompanying balance sheet. The remaining 2024 reimbursable costs of $364 thousand, $111 thousand and $495 thousand are included in Non-recoverable costs, General and administrative expenses, and Interest expense, net, respectively, on the accompanying statement of operations. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 45.68pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -45.68pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(10)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.35pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Member's Equity&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Profit, losses and distributions are allocated in accordance with the provisions of the Company's Limited Liability agreement. During 2025 and 2024, the Company received equity contributions from the California Holdings of $106.2 million and $130.0 million, respectively. Additionally, in 2025, California Holdings made a non-cash transfer of $181.0 million to the Company related to debt and deferred financing costs associated with the Holdco Credit Agreement related to the Manning Project, Collinsville Project, Metcalf Project and Newark Projects awarded in 2023.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;As of June 2024, California Holdings agreed to contribute $60.5 million of additional equity to the Company to fund a portion of the Gates Project and RM Project costs pursuant to amended Equity Contribution Agreements entered into between California Holdings and the collateral agent. This equity commitment is supported by a guaranty from indirect parent, LSP Grid Holdings, LLC. Of this commitment, $39.8 million remains to be funded as of December 31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 45.68pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -45.68pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 2; orphans: 2"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(11)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.35pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&