        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-673_336124_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Represents the amount transferred from FERC account 303 to 397.2 as a result of FERC Order 898.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-794_336128_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>During 2024, before commercial operations in Q1 2025, the Company wrote off $4,014,649 to FERC Account 426.5 toward meeting capital cost caps included in development agreements for the Gates and Round Mountain Projects. The write-offs in line 1, Column (e) serve toward meeting capital cost caps included in the development agreements for the Gates (Orchard Substation) and Round Mountain (Fern Road Substation) projects.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-905_336125_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 40px; max-width: 850px; margin: auto; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); border: 1px solid rgba(204, 204, 204, 1)">    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px"><h2 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold">RECONCILIATION OF REPORTED NET INCOME</h2>        <h2 style="font-size: 11pt; margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold">WITH FEDERAL TAXABLE INCOME</h2>    </div>    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 10pt" class="e-rte-table">                    <tr>                <td style="width: 30px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">1.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px">Net Income per Statement of Income</td>                <td style="text-align: right; width: 140px; padding: 2px">16,947,297</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></td></tr>            <tr>                <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">2.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px">Federal Income Taxes</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">103,402</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></td></tr>            <tr>                <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">3.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px">Excess Capital Loss over Capital Gain</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">0</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></td></tr>            <tr>                <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">4.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px; font-weight: bold">Taxable Income not Recorded on Books:</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">0</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 40px 2px 2px; text-align: right; font-weight: bold">Total Line 4</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">0</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></td></tr>            <tr>                <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">5.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px; font-weight: bold">Expenses Recorded on Books not Included on Return:</td>                <td><br /></td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Lobbying expenses and political contributions</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">127,239</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Meals and entertainment</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">0</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Amortization of carrying charge-equity</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">1,724</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Amortization of carrying charge-debt</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">6,295</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Start-up costs</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">17,714</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Interest expense</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">13,049,443</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Deferred state income tax expense</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">-170,822</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Rent expense</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">-767</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Cost cap write-off</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">5,969,411</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 40px 2px 2px; text-align: right; font-weight: bold">Total Line 5</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">19,000,237</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></td></tr>            <tr style="font-weight: bold">                <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">6.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px">Total of Items 1-5</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">36,050,936</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></td></tr>            <tr>                <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">7.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px; font-weight: bold">Income Recorded on Books not included on Return:</td>                <td><br /></td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">AFUDC-equity</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">-16,778,537</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">AFUDC-debt</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">-14,463,558</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Accrual of Reg Carrying Charges-Equity Rate</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">-38,952</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Accrual of Reg Carrying Charges-Debt Rate</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">-42,387</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 40px 2px 2px; text-align: right; font-weight: bold">Total Line 7</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">-31,323,434</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></td></tr>            <tr>                <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">8.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px; font-weight: bold">Deductions on Return not Charged Against Book Income:</td>                <td><br /></td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 2px 2px 20px">Depreciation expense</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">-2,473,559</td>            </tr>            <tr>                <td><br /></td>                <td style="padding: 2px 40px 2px 2px; text-align: right; font-weight: bold">Total Line 8</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)">-2,473,559</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></td></tr>            <tr>                <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 2px">9.</td>                <td style="padding: 2px">Total of Items 7 &amp; 8</td>                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 2px">-33,796,993</td>            </tr>            <tr><td colspan="3" style="height: 10px"><br /></t