        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1178_336126_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Revenue earned from CAISO per the revenue requirement for transmission services filed with FERC<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1416_336134_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Represents the date the loan facility was transferred from LS Power Grid California, Holdings, LLC to LS Power Grid California, LLC. The date of issuance to LS Power Grid California, Holdings, LLC is 2024-07-22.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1421_336133_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The Credit Agreement consists of an $600 million Term Loan Facility and a $50 million Revolving Facility to be drawn over time to fund construction costs<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1422_336132_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The Credit Agreement consists of an $81 million Term Loan Facility and a $5 million Revolving Facility to be drawn over time to fund construction costs<br /></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
